---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="easyhaloo · 技术笔记与工程译文" description="easyhaloo 的技术笔记、历史博客归档与 Anthropic Engineering 中文译文。">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> EST. 2018 · REBUILT WITH ASTRO</p>
      <h1>把技术沉淀为<br /><em>可回访的知识。</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">从过去的工程笔记到正在发生的技术实践。这里保留可追溯的历史文章，也持续整理值得反复阅读的工程内容。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/engineering-cn/">浏览工程译文 <b>↗</b></a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/legacy/">查看历史归档</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="icon-frame"><img src="/easyhaloo-icon.png" alt="" /></div>
      <span class="art-note note-one">思考</span>
      <span class="art-note note-two">沉淀</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="站点内容概览">
    <div><strong>01</strong><span>工程实践<br />持续更新</span></div>
    <div><strong>230+</strong><span>历史静态文件<br />完整归档</span></div>
    <div><strong>CN</strong><span>中文阅读入口<br />保留原文链接</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> EXPLORE</p>
      <h2>两条持续延展的<br />技术阅读路径。</h2>
    </div>
    <p>新内容与历史积累并行存在。每个入口都采用适合其内容属性的阅读方式，而不是把所有内容塞进同一种模板。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-grid" aria-label="站点内容入口">
    <a class="feature feature-engineering" href="/engineering-cn/">
      <div class="card-top"><span class="card-index">01</span><span class="status">持续更新</span></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="kicker">ENGINEERING READING</p>
        <h3>Anthropic Engineering<br />中文译文</h3>
        <p>经本地 CLI Agent 转写、校验并保留图文布局的中文阅读版本，适合深入理解工程决策与实践。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-footer"><span>进入专题</span><b>→</b></div>
    </a>

    <a class="feature feature-archive" href="/legacy/">
      <div class="card-top"><span class="card-index">02</span><span class="status">历史存档</span></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="kicker">FROM THE ARCHIVE</p>
        <h3>技术博客<br />2018—</h3>
        <p>Java、JavaScript、Spring Cloud、MyBatis、Linux 与工程实践的原始文章、分类和标签索引。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-footer"><span>打开归档</span><b>→</b></div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="manifesto-mark"><img src="/easyhaloo-icon.png" alt="" /></div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> PUBLISHING PRINCIPLES</p>
      <h2>清晰、可追溯、<br /><em>可长期维护。</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p>外部来源译文明确标记为非官方中文译文，并保留英文原文链接。发布流程由版本控制和静态构建保存记录，使每一次内容更新都可检查、可回滚。</p>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.18fr) minmax(260px, .82fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); padding: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 6.25rem) 0 clamp(3.8rem, 7vw, 5.8rem); }
    .eyebrow, .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: .73rem; letter-spacing: .13em; font-weight: 770; color: var(--accent); }
    .eyebrow span { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: .5rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); vertical-align: 1px; }
    h1 { margin: .92rem 0 1.35rem; max-width: 760px; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7.1vw, 6.45rem); line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -.078em; font-weight: 790; }
    h1 em, .manifesto h2 em { font-family: ui-serif, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 420; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    .lede { max-width: 610px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.03rem, 1.6vw, 1.15rem); }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .72rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .9rem; padding: .76rem 1.05rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-weight: 720; transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease; }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .button.primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, transparent); }
    .button.primary b { font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: .8; }
    .button.secondary { color: var(--ink); background: var(--surface); }
    .hero-art { position: relative; width: min(100%, 390px); aspect-ratio: 1; justify-self: end; display: grid; place-items: center; }
    .icon-frame { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 70%; border-radius: 28%; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 28px 55px rgba(15, 39, 31, .25); transform: rotate(4deg); border: 8px solid var(--surface); }
    .icon-frame img { width: 100%; display: block; }
    .orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 50%; }
    .orbit-one { inset: 5%; }
    .orbit-two { inset: 17%; transform: rotate(-22deg) scaleX(1.24); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 50%, var(--line)); }
    .art-note { position: absolute; z-index: 3; padding: .35rem .62rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 92%, transparent); color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(21, 33, 26, .08); }
    .note-one { top: 10%; right: 0; }
    .note-two { left: 0; bottom: 13%; }
    .signal-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .signal-strip div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1.15rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .signal-strip div:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
    .signal-strip div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .signal-strip strong { min-width: 2.7rem; font-size: 1.28rem; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: var(--accent); }
    .signal-strip span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.4; }
    .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr; align-items: end; gap: 2rem; padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7.5rem) 0 2.15rem; }
    .section-heading h2, .manifesto h2 { margin: .7rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.6vw, 4.2rem); letter-spacing: -.066em; line-height: .98; }
    .section-heading > p { max-width: 460px; margin: 0 0 .25rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .feature-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr .88fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .feature { min-height: 410px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.55rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease; }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); color: var(--ink); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .feature-engineering { background: radial-gradient(circle at 88% 20%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-soft) 80%, transparent), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), var(--surface-alt)); }
    .feature-archive { background: var(--surface); }
    .card-top, .card-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .card-index { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .status { padding: .27rem .52rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 720; }
    .card-body { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 4rem; }
    .kicker { font-size: .68rem; }
    .feature h3 { margin: .55rem 0 .82rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    .feature p:last-child { max-width: 35rem; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .card-footer { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 76%, transparent); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 760; }
    .card-footer b { font-size: 1.3rem; }
    .manifesto { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1.05fr .95fr; gap: clamp(1.3rem, 4vw, 4rem); align-items: center; margin-top: clamp(4.8rem, 10vw, 8rem); padding: 2.2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .manifesto-mark { width: 72px; border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(19, 50, 40, .18); }
    .manifesto-mark img { width: 100%; display: block; }
    .manifesto h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.3vw, 3rem); }
    .manifesto > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 800px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .hero-art { justify-self: start; width: min(72vw, 340px); margin-top: .6rem; } .feature-grid, .section-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .section-heading { gap: 1.2rem; } .manifesto { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; } .manifesto > p { grid-column: 1 / -1; } }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .hero { padding-top: 2.8rem; } .hero-art { width: min(82vw, 315px); } .signal-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .signal-strip div, .signal-strip div:first-child { padding: .85rem 0; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } .signal-strip div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; } .feature { min-height: 350px; padding: 1.25rem; } .card-body { padding-top: 3.2rem; } .manifesto { gap: 1rem; } .manifesto-mark { width: 58px; border-radius: 18px; } }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
